00:01:56.720 --> 00:01:58.970
2.43: Seiin High School Boys Volleyball Team

00:03:13.950 --> 00:03:16.830
Chika! Chika!

00:03:16.830 --> 00:03:18.080
Yuni...

00:03:19.410 --> 00:03:24.040
A-Are you really going to Tokyo?
We can't see each other anymore?

00:03:24.040 --> 00:03:25.410
Yeah...

00:03:25.410 --> 00:03:30.490
I won't forget you...
I'll never forget you, Yuni!

00:03:30.490 --> 00:03:34.700
I'll never forget you either, Chika!

00:03:35.700 --> 00:03:40.200
I wish we could stay together forever.

00:03:40.200 --> 00:03:42.830
Goodbye, Yuni.

00:03:50.450 --> 00:03:52.160
So, I heard...

00:03:52.160 --> 00:03:54.540
...that the transfer student's gonna be late.

00:03:54.540 --> 00:03:58.910
I wonder if he's hot. I hope he's hot.

00:03:58.910 --> 00:04:01.950
He's totally average. Maybe even below average.

00:04:01.950 --> 00:04:05.660
But you only knew him when
you were in kindergarten, right?

00:04:05.660 --> 00:04:07.830
Maybe he's hotter now.

00:04:07.830 --> 00:04:12.080
Nah. I'm sure he's still a four-eyed
shrimp who's bad at sports.

00:04:12.080 --> 00:04:16.660
What's with you? Are you pouting?
You're such a child.

00:04:16.660 --> 00:04:20.240
Shut up. Stop acting like my older sister

00:04:20.240 --> 00:04:21.830
Go back to your own class.

00:04:21.830 --> 00:04:24.490
Yeah, yeah, you little brat.

00:04:25.700 --> 00:04:29.540
I'm wearing shorts under there,
so peeking won't do you any good.

00:04:29.540 --> 00:04:32.620
Wool shorts. Talk about lame.

00:04:32.620 --> 00:04:35.580
I don't get why you bother wearing those.

00:04:35.580 --> 00:04:37.740
I'll have you know these are stylish.

00:04:37.740 --> 00:04:40.660
I guess a little kid like you
wouldn't understand.

00:04:40.660 --> 00:04:43.790
Is your cousin causing you trouble again, Yuni?

00:04:43.790 --> 00:04:45.910
Please. Shut your mouth.

00:04:45.910 --> 00:04:48.830
I heard the transfer student's
a childhood friend of yours.

00:04:48.830 --> 00:04:50.160
From kindergarten.

00:04:50.160 --> 00:04:52.660
You lookin' forward to the reunion?

00:04:52.660 --> 00:04:55.450
Please. He's a dude.

00:04:56.790 --> 00:05:00.160
Actually, I was pretty excited.

00:05:01.870 --> 00:05:06.080
What's his problem? He finished
moving here during winter break,

00:05:06.080 --> 00:05:08.580
and he never came to see me once.

00:05:23.830 --> 00:05:25.080
Chika!

00:05:38.080 --> 00:05:40.040
Huh?

00:05:40.040 --> 00:05:44.410
Did Chika not recognize me?

00:05:45.240 --> 00:05:48.820
Class 2-1

